{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q22.material.recovered", "text": "请阅读下列材料，并按要求作答。小学新教师杨洋在谈教育感受时，有些无奈地说：“刚走上教育岗位时，我坚信‘没有爱，就没有教育’，”因此，在教育教学中我一直对学生充满着爱心，希望用自己的爱来感化学生，带好班级，促使他们成长。但很快就发现，在管理班级时一定要严格要求，有时用简单命令的方式反而更加奏效，这使我对这一教育信念产生了困惑……”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1448, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1613, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 22, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q22"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m3.k01", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k02", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.design", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r020", "ntce.outline.202.r022", "ntce.outline.202.r031", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045", "ntce.outline.202.r046"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q22"], "word_count": 165, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1448, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1613, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excer