{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q23.material.recovered", "text": "请阅读下列课堂实录片段，并按要求作答。孙老师在二(1)班上完《小壁虎借尾巴》一课后，设计了两项家庭作业让学生选择完成：(1)把“小壁虎借尾巴”这个故事讲给自己喜欢的人听；(2)你还知道哪些动物尾巴的作用呢？你是怎么知道的？想一想，明天上课时与小伙伴交流一下。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1684, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1813, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k02", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.design", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r031", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045", "ntce.outline.202.r046"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2011b.q23"], "word_count": 129, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a1b4e7a1958702b560bd16175f502ecc5b10389ac5be1985c513684068b171c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1684, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1813, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23,